        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♒ The Aquarius Cloth.</strong> <em>[OFFENSE/removal]</em></p><h3>Cloth Passive — Cold Blood</h3><p>You have cold resistance equal to your level and are immune to the effects of severe cold environments. You gain a +1 status bonus to Will saves against emotion effects, and you are trained in Occultism or Arcana (your choice).</p><h3>Techniques</h3><ul><li><strong>1st &mdash; Signature (L1)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Diamond Dust]</li><li><strong>2nd (L6)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Koliço]</li><li><strong>3rd &mdash; Cloth Ability (L11)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Freezing Shield]</li><li><strong>4th &mdash; Ultimate (L16)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Freezing Coffin]</li></ul><h3>Ascendant Boon — Freezing Coffin <em>[OFFENSE/removal]</em></h3><p>Cold damage from you forces a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC or <strong>slowed 1</strong>, cumulative — at <strong>slowed 4</strong> the creature is instead <strong>petrified in ice</strong>, which any critical hit shatters permanently.</p><p>Your cold damage ignores cold resistance and treats cold immunity as cold resistance 10.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Ascendant (Aquarius)]</p><h3>Zenith Boon — Aurora Execution <em>[removal]</em></h3><p>As the Ascendant Boon, plus <strong><em>Aurora Execution</em></strong> once per minute &#9670;&#9670;&#9670;: 60-foot line, @Damage[16d6[cold]] damage, basic Fortitude; a critical failure leaves the creature <strong>frozen solid</strong> (petrified, shatterable). <strong>Incapacitation.</strong></p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Zenith (Aquarius)]</p>"
        },
